454
00:32:52,583 --> 00:32:53,583
Charles Heller?

455
00:32:54,750 --> 00:32:55,583
Charlie.

456
00:32:56,458 --> 00:32:57,542
Kau terlambat.

457
00:32:59,833 --> 00:33:01,416
Dengan hormat, sebenarnya aku sekitar...

458
00:33:01,417 --> 00:33:02,958
Kau terlambat.

459
