Letakkan jarimu di pelatuknya!

580
00:39:54,708 --> 00:39:55,999
Ayo.

581
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:57,083
Lihat aku.

582
00:40:01,375 --> 00:40:02,250
Ayo.

583
00:40:03,042 --> 00:40:04,917
Ayo, Charlie.

584
